<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia Jan/Feb industrial output rises y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia Jan/Feb industrial output rises y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia on Wednesday reported the following preliminary economic indicator details.</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT</p>
<p>					Feb   Jan  Dec'96 Feb'96 Jan'96</p>
<p> Index (1996 average=100)    97.3   97.6  95.2   93.6   94.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Data for January and February 1997 comprises only 70 percent of Slovenian companies. The Statistical Office said it would announce the final figures next week.</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
